      "english": "“You’re welcome,” Chacha said, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "“主人看见我们的时候，会和我们玩；主人没看见我们的时候，会忘了我们。”",
      "traditional": "“主人看見我們的時候，會和我們玩；主人沒看見我們的時候，會忘了我們。”",
      "pinyin": "zhǔ rén kàn jiàn wǒ men de shí hou huì hé wǒ men wán zhǔ rén méi kàn jiàn wǒ men de shí hou huì wàng le wǒ men",
      "english": ".. “When our owners see us, they will play with us. When our owners don’t see us, they will forget us.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "我说：“看见我们，看见我们……我知道了！我们要在桌子上面，我们要在主人前面。”",
      "traditional": "我說：“看見我們，看見我們……我知道了！我們要在桌子上面，我們要在主人前面。”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ shuō kàn jiàn wǒ men kàn jiàn wǒ men wǒ zhī dào le wǒ men yào zài zhuō zi shàng miàn wǒ men yào zài zhǔ rén qián miàn",
      "english": "I said, “See us, see us … I know! We have to be on the table; we have to be in front of our owners.”"
    },
