    "sentence_translations": [
      "In Front of My Owner",
      "",
      "Now I was on the table, and I could see Chacha. ",
      "",
      "“Thank you!” I was so happy. ",
      "",
      "“You’re welcome,” Chacha said, ..",
      ".. “When our owners see us, they will play with us. When our owners don’t see us, they will forget us.”",
      "",
      "I said, “See us, see us … I know! We have to be on the table; we have to be in front of our owners.”",
      "",
      "Chacha said, “Yes! We shouldn’t be in our owner’s clothes, and we shouldn’t be under books.",
      "We have to be in front of them and make them see us.”",
      "",
      "“Great! He saw us. We can play together!” I said.",
      ""
    ]
